{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/pulls/365","id":4717184684,"node_id":"PR_kwDOT8bGF88AAAABGSqGrA","html_url":"https://github.com/arhancanli/canlicapital/pull/365","diff_url":"https://github.com/arhancanli/canlicapital/pull/365.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/arhancanli/canlicapital/pull/365.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/issues/365","number":365,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Bound research MCP response bytes and validate cache admission","user":{"login":"arhancanli","id":315329124,"node_id":"U_kgDOEsuKZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/315329124?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli","html_url":"https://github.com/arhancanli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Research MCP currently checks JavaScript string length after materializing the body, caches malformed JSON before parsing, and accepts negative cache ages after clock rollback. This change counts at most 4 MiB of native response-stream bytes before strict UTF-8 decoding, keeps the existing 15-second signal active through fetch and body reads, skips HTTP error bodies, and admits JSON to the ten-minute cache only after parsing.\n\nKnown failures cancel and release the reader once; late fetch completions are discarded. Cache ages must be finite and nonnegative, and a failed concurrent response preserves a newer valid entry. Six tools, schemas, descriptions, metadata, successful result shapes, source limits, versions and dependencies are unchanged.\n\nValidation: 32 new native Response/ReadableStream cases are WRITTEN, including exact-cap/overflow/header/UTF-8/cleanup/deadline/HTTP/cache-concurrency fixtures and successful tool shapes. Existing research fixtures remain unchanged; existing remote CI is the first runtime gate. No local project jobs or CI reruns. Signed clean source e01eeb3b49bd310a9e9b83c75ea1fef6da20c8aa, sole parent actual main438d8799, tree3ae6c1d2; separate PRIMARY/THIRD source and retained exact-CI reviews remain open.\n\nThe limit covers accepted body bytes. A transport may already have allocated an oversized chunk, and JavaScript cannot preempt a blocked event loop or synchronous transport; no total-memory or hosted-latency claim. Unreleased repository work only; all full owner goals remain active and real indexing, expert rights/labels, adoption and qualified strategy outcomes remain unknown.\n","created_at":"2026-10-02T13:44:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T13:44:52Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c46ce7f7bd16e4afb798df8340a5e871dcbe2857","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/pulls/365/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/pulls/365/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/issues/365/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/statuses/e01eeb3b49bd310a9e9b83c75ea1fef6da20c8aa","head":{"label":"arhancanli:assist/research-response-bounds-20261002","ref":"assist/research-respons